    justification:  # 1bd0
    description: "Laravel route_handler has no suffix-match fallback (Rails has one). PHP backslash-namespaced FQ names like App\\Http\\Controllers\\UserController won't match the short UserController@index from route DSL. Fix: add suffix scan analogous to Rails _resolve_rails_handler step 4."  # 1bd0
